products.push({name:'The Suits.me Gift Card',fabric:'Digital gift card',color:'Digital',price:100,img:'model-accessories.webp',category:'Gifts',kind:'gift',tag:'GIVE PERSONAL STYLE'});
const faqs=[['How do I find my measurements?','Open the measurement studio. Choose guided body measurements or standard US sizes, then follow each step. The body measurement route includes jacket and trouser measurements, visual guidance, and a final review.'],['Should I add room for comfort?','Enter your actual body measurements without adding ease. Choose Slim, Tailored, or Relaxed to describe your preferred fit. Your tailoring team should confirm the production pattern and allowances.'],['Can I use centimeters?','Yes. Switch between inches and centimeters in the measurement studio. Values are converted automatically, and saved profiles keep the selected unit.'],['Can I reuse my fit profile?','Yes. Saved profiles appear in the profile menu and in the final customization step. This design preview stores them in your current browser.'],['Can I get measured in person?','Visit one of the New York-area showrooms listed on our Locations page. Contact the showroom directly to confirm availability.'],['What happens at checkout?','The complete demo checkout records a sample order without taking a payment. Once merchant setup is complete, secure payment is handled by Authorize.Net’s hosted form.'],['Are these photographs of available inventory?','The model imagery is AI-generated to demonstrate the shopping experience. Garment names, fabric selections, pricing, and production details must be matched to the business catalog before live selling.'],['How do I change an order or discuss fit?','Contact your showroom or stylist with your order reference. For demo orders, return to the collection to build another configuration.']];
